Since $Z_{bp^s-1}=Z_{(b-1)p^s+(p^s-1)}=tZ_{(b-1)p^s}Z_{p^s-1}$ for $b\le p$, the above equation becomes $$tZ_{ap^s}Z_{p^s-1}(1+tZ_{2p^s})=tZ_{p^s-1}(tZ_{p^s}Z_{(a-1)p^s}+tZ_{(a+1)p^s}Z_{p^s}).$$

Therefore, $$Z_{ap^s}=\frac{tZ_{p^s}}{1+tZ_{2p^s}}(Z_{(a-1)p^s}+Z_{(a+1)p^s}).$$ 



