Therefore, $\{F_n(t)\}_{n=2}^\infty$ and $\{Q_n(t)\}_{n=2}^\infty$ satisfy the same second order recurrence. A direct computation shows that the sequence $F_n(t)$ and $Q_n(t)$ have the same initial two values; hence, they are the same sequence.
\end{proof}

